## Genetic Algorithm Process Flow

flowchart LR
  Start["Create Random Population"] --> Test["Test Each Solution"]
  Test --> Score["Give Fitness Score"]
  Score --> Select["Keep Best Solutions"]
  Select --> Reproduce["Create Next Generation"]
  Reproduce --> Mutate["Add Small Mutations"]
  Mutate --> Test